{"duration_api_ms":11609,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"9588eff0-5264-4139-b944-cd979dfa5cd2","total_cost_usd":0.0355554,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1037,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1354,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":994},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1037,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1354,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1037,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1037},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1604,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0001714,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":1354,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1037,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.035384,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":994,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":1037,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**The existing contract terminates automatically.** Section 15(a)(4) of the Investment Company Act of 1940 requires advisory contracts to terminate on \"assignment.\" Under Section 2(a)(4), assignment includes a change of control of the adviser. Owning over 25% of voting securities is presumed control.\n\n**A new advisory contract needs two approvals:**\n1. **Board**, including a majority of independent directors (Section 15(c)), traditionally voting in person.\n2. **Shareholders**, by a \"majority of outstanding voting securities\" (Section 15(a)). This is the lesser of 67% of shares present (if over 50% are present) or more than 50% of outstanding shares.\n\n**Interim contract:** Rule 15a-4 allows a board-approved interim contract for up to 150 days during proxy solicitation. Fees can't exceed the old contract's and are held in escrow pending shareholder approval.\n\n**Section 15(f) safe harbor** protects the selling adviser if at least 75% of the board is independent for three years and no \"unfair burden\" is imposed on the fund for two years.","ttft_ms":8795,"type":"result","duration_ms":11152,"uuid":"92587400-96d0-42c1-8eaa-4d0b547341ed","ttft_stream_ms":521,"time_to_request_ms":71,"first_content_frame_ms":521,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
